<title>USA: ATL Ultrasound sets 1 mln share repurchase.</title>
<headline>ATL Ultrasound sets 1 mln share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATL Ultrasound Inc said Wednesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 1 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>To date, ATL has repurchased 436,800 shares of its common stock under a program authorized a year ago. That program is superseded by the new authorization.</p>
<p>Shares repurchased will be used to service ATL's employee benefit plans and for other general corporate purposes. At the end of March ATL had about 14.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
